  "description": "The all new Lava Dome is kind of like your best friend, but in bike form. It’s awesome in the dirt. It’s awesome to rally around town. It’s awesome poking around neighborhood singletrack, and it does it all in a dependable way. The all new Lava Dome features an easy-to-use 9-speed drivetrain with a clutch rear derailleur as well as sleek internal cable routing and dropouts. Available for smaller riders in a 26” wheeled XS version, a 27.5” wheel for size S, and 29” wheel for sizes M-XL. These strong wheels can accept up to a 2.3” tires–this bike is ready for everything in its path!",
